WEBVTT

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.930
This is my final attack!

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.550
White Nagamushi!

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.850
Go!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:26.710
<i>Yougorai that can be 
controlled from a distance?</i>

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:39.630
<i>No matter how fast your reactions 
are, it's too late now.</i>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:45.520
What?

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.540
<i>The months that pass within my dreams</i>

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:09.460
<i>I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair</i>

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:15.720
<i>If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes</i>

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:21.180
<i>In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world</i>

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:25.060
<i>Shangri-la is nowhere to be found</i>

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:30.860
<i>No one knows the love of the spring wind</i>

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:40.070
<i>The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over</i>

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:48.040
<i>Trading places, they bloom then wilt</i>

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.880
<i>In January, I pick a flower with no petals</i>

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:59.220
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.720
<i>In March, the peach blossoms bloom</i>

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:10.690
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.730
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.820
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:28.750
<b>16: Exorcism</b>

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:44.720
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:43.770
You're full of surprises.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:47.260
I had no idea you'd achieved 
such mastery of Yougorai.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:54.220
No matter how hard I tried,
I couldn't dodge your attack.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:03:00.640
You truly are more talented than me.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:08.320
Even if you're beaten, it will simply 
be because I've trained longer.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.430
I appreciate it.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.230
He lost...

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.250
Reigyoku-sama, you can do it!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.240
Come on, cheer for him.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.760
Don't just stare at him.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:26.080
But Reigyoku-sama has never 
looked so arousing to me before.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:32.600
Reigyoku-sama's handsome when he's 
his usual cool self, but today...

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:36.000
I'd like to push him down and tease him.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.950
Fantastic. Fantastic, Chou Soran.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.410
Thanks to you,

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:49.620
I've been able to push the negative ki 
within me to its limit for the first time.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.170
My Jinrai...

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.450
I can't use it.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.630
This is the difference in our strength.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:03.390
All that's left for me to 
do is take my chances.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.010
Sorry, Hou-nee.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.800
I didn't think someone who hadn't 
trained with the Tenshifu

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.320
would put up this much of a fight.

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:18.070
You are worthy of succeeding the Tenshi.

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:22.300
And I will defeat you...

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:28.270
in order to surpass my ideal self 
that exists inside my heart!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.410
Chou Soran lost...

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.510
The Tenshi won't tell us anything else now.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.910
I'll never learn anything.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.490
It's over... It's over...

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.480
Houhou, look.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.350
Oh...

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:06.270
Wh-Why? My body feels numb...

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.810
Is this because of the 
Yougorai you used earlier?

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.910
I thought I removed the effects 
of the attack using my Ingorai.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:22.460
Is it because I released Ingorai?

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.300
I see...

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:32.670
This is my punishment for rejecting Ingorai.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.560
Reigyoku, you...

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.930
Chou Reigyoku, can you continue fighting?

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:41.790
Or will you surrender?

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.240
I surrender...

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:56.250
No way!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:58.260
Reigyoku-sama!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:03.500
I can't believe I suffered 
such an unsightly defeat.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:08.960
I'm sorry, Master.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:14.680
Unbelievable. What happened to Reigyoku?

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:16.510
Who knows?

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:20.130
He must've eaten something 
that didn't agree with him.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:25.230
The winner is Chou Soran!

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.350
What?!

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:32.250
No way...

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.820
I can't believe Chou Reigyoku lost.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:39.800
Hana-chan, how am I going 
to survive the next month?

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.460
How much did you bet on Reigyoku?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.530
My entire budget for this month!

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.260
Wow, that was stupid of you.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.150
You bitch!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.500
You're the only one who 
bet on Soran, aren't you?

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.480
Well, yes.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:55.080
You must've had some insider information 
to bet on that piece of shit!

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.190
How could you leave me out of the loop?!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.470
You have a surprisingly foul mouth.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:02.480
A month's living expenses are on 
the line! I'm desperate here!

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.940
I didn't have any information.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.660
I just thought Chou Soran was too lucky.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.610
Huh?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:15.410
He only ever fought one proper 
fight at this tournament.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:19.930
He won as though the 
heavens were on his side.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:24.690
Naturally, he couldn't have made 
it to the finals on luck alone.

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:28.120
Someone must've been helping him.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.590
That's why I bet on him.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.240
Impressive as always, Hana-oneesama.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:37.210
By the way, could you lend me some 
money for living expenses next month?

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:40.230
Onee-sama? I thought I was a bitch...

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.380
Rinron-senpai?

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:46.760
It is you, Rinron-senpai.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.900
Did you not watch the finals?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.860
Brother, who is she?

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:54.390
Ah, right. You haven't met her yet.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.390
This woman is a senior disciple.

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.860
She's far more advanced than we are.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:04.550
By the way, the master 
was talking about you.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.620
He was wondering when you'd 
be returning to Hakuunkan.

00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:11.470
I've been busy with school and stuff.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.140
How's everyone doing?

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.090
Quite well, of course.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:19.560
That's good. I'll go see them 
once I'm finished here.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.270
Let them know.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.780
I will. Excuse us.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.110
What's wrong?

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.980
Is Zensei really coming?

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.020
I think Grandfather is overthinking it.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:38.040
Everyone's starting to descend the mountain.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.620
We've been on our guard since 
the tournament started,

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.030
but we only caught their underling Ko Ketsu.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:50.190
I doubt even Zensei would attack Ryuukosan

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:54.450
while there are so many 
martial artists here.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:00.340
Did Tambor-sensei and his friend 
make it down the mountain safely?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:02.050
Yes, Master.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.280
Good. You can go now.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.440
Excuse me.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.450
I wasn't expecting this match-up.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:28.810
Soran will face Shokatsu 
Sei after his next match.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:32.290
Looks like the heavens aren't on his side.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.000
Really, now, who could 
that be so late at night?

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:42.760
Don't just stand there. Come in.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:48.030
Hello, Tenshi.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:53.160
Ouya. Are you plotting something nasty?

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:56.150
Of course not.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.570
I came to solve your problem.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.620
Solve my problem?

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:11.570
Yes. Don't worry about Shokatsu Sei.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:14.930
I'm his next opponent.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:18.940
If you, the leader of the Tenshifu,

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:23.130
drove the bukou style's Shokatsu 
Sei out of the tournament,

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:25.850
you'd damage the Tenshifu's name.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:29.840
You should banish the 
thought immediately.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:37.200
You'd not only tarnish the Tenshifu's 
honor, but even change your own.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.810
I'll handle Shokatsu Sei.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:44.120
How do you know so much?

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:51.080
Never mind. You should not 
poke your nose into my business.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.790
I'm telling you this for your sake, as well.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:58.060
Of course. I'm not interested in trouble.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:01.740
Are you confident you'll beat Shokatsu Sei?

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:05.710
I'm not sure Reigyoku could 
beat him. He's strong.

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.190
I think so.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.730
Would you like to test 
your skills against me?

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.230
Yeah, sure.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.250
In that case, forgive me!

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:22.200
Don't rush.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.650
We'll fight once we're outside.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.540
Fuukou Qimen!

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:28.610
Rankintaku!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:42.220
<i>I expended so much energy after 
only a single use of Rankintaku.</i>

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:46.790
<i>This is the shouitsu style, 
the true strength of the Tenshi.</i>

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.490
I see.

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:58.680
Butousan's Unryuu isn't your only master.

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:02.140
Don't answer.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:06.480
I'm not interested in sticking 
my nose into your business.

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:10.250
Now, go on back and rest.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.510
Shokatsu Sei is a powerful opponent.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:18.590
Yes, Tenshi. Excuse me.

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:24.880
Ro Ji, Ou Ai, Fuu Chonhan...

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:31.210
They all plot to disrupt the world.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:36.060
<b>Shokatsu Sei              Ouya</b>

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:35.240
This time, even young men have shown up.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:43.340
In the end, the source of all harm is 
the 36 families of the Koushin War.

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.070
Kaigi...

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:49.580
If you hadn't left Ryuukosan,

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:54.170
the Tenshi's seat would be yours now.

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.060
Master.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.630
I'm sorry.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:12.050
I should be apologizing to you.

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:13.050
Absolutely not.

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:15.350
It's all my fault.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.880
I disappointed you

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.650
in such a disgraceful fashion.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.620
I even embarrassed you.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:29.220
I wasted all the training I did here.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:32.720
I can't bear to face the others.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:35.580
I drugged you.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.820
What? Drugged me?

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.140
You still haven't noticed?

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.420
This medicine reduces your ki.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:50.090
A single tablet of this drug would make even 
the ki of a legendary wizard stop flowing.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:53.410
I put this in your breakfast this morning.

00:13:53.940 --> 00:14:00.150
I adjusted the dose so it would only take 
effect when you fought at full strength.

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.570
Is that so?

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.180
Good.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.980
Why are you relieved?

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:14.620
I thought I had disappointed you 
because of a mistake I made.

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:18.240
But you planned this.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:19.940
This is all wrong!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.090
Why aren't you angry about this?!

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:26.550
You should be overcome with despair 
because your master betrayed you!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:31.770
You should be crying and 
screaming, "Why, Master?"

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.160
Got it?

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.710
Um...

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:41.430
It is true that I'd like to 
know why you did this.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:46.770
But if you could tell me, 
you would have already.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:50.940
You would've ordered me 
to lose to Chou Soran.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:56.770
If I had ordered you to do it, 
you would've quietly complied.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.340
But that would mean...

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:03.870
I don't need to know why right now.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.180
I am a monk of Ryuukosan.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.170
I have all the patience in the world.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:14.040
Honestly, you are earnest 
to a fault, aren't you?

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:20.740
With your personality, it'll be hard for you 
to push your negative power to its limit.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.110
Well, no matter. Reigyoku...

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:24.830
Yes?

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:28.200
Do exactly as I order you to do.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.910
Tomorrow, the award ceremony 
for the tournament will be held.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.750
When you're forced to make a decision then,

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:40.290
you must choose the opposite 
of what you'd normally choose.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:54.770
The smooth shoulder pole, ah, gayahariya...

00:15:55.540 --> 00:16:00.640
Is carrying rice to Liuzhou...

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:58.480
Houhou...

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:00.640
She seems to be in a good mood.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.770
The award ceremony will now begin!

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.980
Accept this gift, Chou Soran.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:20.510
As promised, from this moment 
forward, the Tsuutenroku is yours.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.230
That's the Tsuutenroku, 
one of the eight secret arts?

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.740
What kind of technique is it?

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:34.500
Thank you, Rikukin-sama.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:37.090
But I can't accept this.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.550
This is unexpected.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:45.170
He doesn't want the Tsuutenroku?

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:46.110
What's going on?

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.810
He must be crazy.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.120
You really don't want it?

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:56.880
Rikukin-sama, because of the 
kitaigen style I barely understand,

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:58.650
I've run into all kinds of trouble.

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:02.970
The Tsuutenroku is as famous 
as the kitaigen style.

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:09.750
Others may see it as a treasure, but having 
it would only increase my troubles.

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.280
I don't need it.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:21.940
For me, returning to Ryuukosan 
was its own greatest reward.

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.710
Now this is a problem.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:28.480
There's no point in me offering 
the Tsuutenroku now.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:32.060
Very well, then. I guess 
I'll take it home with me.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:33.330
Rikukin.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:39.400
Why not take this opportunity 
to pass it on to a youngster?

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:43.390
If first place winner Soran won't accept it,

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:46.500
then why not give it to second 
place winner Reigyoku?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.550
What?

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.980
None of you have any objections, do you?

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:52.520
<i>That clever bastard.</i>

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:57.820
<i>Either way, I have to give the 
Tsuutenroku to one of his students.</i>

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.420
Very well.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:05.790
What? You want me to 
inherit the Tsuutenroku?

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:10.060
But I lost. I don't deserve—

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:11.630
Huh?

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:19.130
<i>When you're forced to make a decision then,</i>

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:24.010
<i>you must choose the opposite 
of what you'd normally choose.</i>

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:28.000
What? You don't want it, either?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.840
Has my Tsuutenroku become a piece 
of trash that nobody wants?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.490
Thank you.

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:40.700
I humbly accept.

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:44.100
I can't believe I watched the whole thing.

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.830
I know! It was so worth it, too!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.810
I'm really tired now.

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.460
So Chou Soran won, huh?

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.980
Well, not that it matters to me 
who becomes the next Tenshi.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:02.080
Me? I left Ryuukosan, and now 
I'm just wandering around.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.270
Are you leaving the mountain, too?

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:07.200
In that case, we could take 
today's flight home together.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.420
You're leaving already?

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:09.320
Shh!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.150
Oh, Dad? That was nothing.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:16.520
What? I'm alone. There's no one else here.

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:19.460
Okay, I'll talk to you later.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.170
You idiot. What if my dad heard you?

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.670
Who cares if he does?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:29.390
L-Listen, Saen.

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:30.450
Uh...

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:34.330
When should we visit my parents?

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:39.710
I mean, shouldn't we go see them?

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:42.730
You haven't met my mom yet.

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:46.910
I messed up.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:50.810
I can't believe there was another kid 
as naïve as Chou Soran around.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:53.330
If I'd known, I wouldn't have done anything.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.880
What's wrong with being inexperienced?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.580
Oh, don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:59.800
You weren't that bad.

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:04.000
But we both had too much to drink last night.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.370
It wasn't anything serious.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.040
What does that mean?!

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.140
What's going to happen to us now? Tell me!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.640
<i>He's leaving me no choice.</i>

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.830
What's this supposed to mean?

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.680
Thanks for waiting, Soran.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:03.780
Now that the guests have left, 
this area is awfully quiet.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:06.610
Master, I...

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:09.320
Don't be so nervous.

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:12.540
You may have become the next Tenshi,

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.400
but you won't become the Tenshi immediately.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:19.060
Your master's still full of energy.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:22.420
Your turn won't be coming for a long time.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.380
What's up?

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.010
I see. Got it. We'll head there immediately.

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:35.590
Soran, Jo San and I need 
to leave for a while.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:38.000
You guys stay here.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.830
Tenshi, we need to get going.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:50.020
Eizan, keep a close watch on Shinchuu.

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:51.650
Of course, Master.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.720
Soran, come with me.

00:21:55.950 --> 00:22:00.730
I will now teach you the way of the Tenshi.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:06.050
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it's 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:10.010
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:14.100
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they're fat and look delicious</i>

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:18.020
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:22.150
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:26.240
<i>Cute, cute girl</i>

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:30.120
<i>She has such a calm face</i>

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:34.040
<i>But with her giant shovel, 
she goes from one hill to the next</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:37.620
<i>And fills them with holes</i>

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:41.880
<i>I don't know where she came from</i>

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:45.710
<i>But if you make her mad, she'll punch you</i>

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:49.840
<i>She's always in a daze, 
but she's terrifying</i>

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:53.640
<i>She'll smack you without 
warning if you're stupid</i>

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:57.770
<i>Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn't shine</i>

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>This dignified girl is never scared</i>

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:05.820
<i>She works hard all night burying</i>

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:09.990
<i>She buries others in order to survive</i>

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:14.240
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it's 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:18.120
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:22.000
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they're fat and look delicious</i>

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:26.090
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers</i>

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:28.840
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't have red peppers...</i>

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:31.180
<i>I don't, I don't, I don't!</i>

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:33.010
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:34.120
The Zensei arc has finally begun!

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:36.400
Although Zensei themselves 
haven't appeared yet...

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:38.590
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Way of the Tenshi."

00:23:38.590 --> 00:23:39.660
Don't miss it!

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>17: Way of               the Tenshi</b>
